  "worked_solution": "We add the exponents, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{3}\\cdot {x}^{2} & = \\\\ {x}^{3+2} & = \\\\ {x}^{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
